<main class="zd-mj-page">

  <section class="zd-mj-hero">
    <div class="zd-mj-hero__copy">
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Life system</p>

      <h1>MyJourney</h1>

      <p>
        A personal life-building app for planning, reflecting, tracking habits,
        setting direction, and becoming better one intentional step at a time.
      </p>

      <div class="zd-mj-actions">
        <a href="#waitlist" class="zd-mj-btn zd-mj-btn--primary">Join Waitlist</a>
        <a href="/pages/roadmap" class="zd-mj-btn zd-mj-btn--secondary">View Roadmap</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-mj-hero__visual">
      {% if section.settings.hero_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="MyJourney app preview"
          width="1200"
          height="900"
          loading="eager"
        >
      {% else %}
        {{ 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'zd-mj-placeholder' }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-mj-purpose">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">The purpose</p>
      <h2>A place to organize the journey of becoming who you want to be.</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      MyJourney is designed for people who want their goals, routines, reflections,
      and personal growth to connect in one calm system. Instead of only tracking
      tasks, it helps users understand where they are going and why it matters.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-mj-features">
    <div class="zd-mj-section-head">
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Core features</p>
      <h2>Plan, reflect, grow, repeat.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-mj-feature-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Daily Planning</h3>
        <p>Choose what matters today and connect it to your larger direction.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Reflections</h3>
        <p>Review your days, weeks, and seasons so growth becomes visible.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Habit Systems</h3>
        <p>Track routines that support the life you are trying to build.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Life Areas</h3>
        <p>Organize growth around school, faith, fitness, language, work, and more.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-mj-showcase">
    <div class="zd-mj-showcase__copy">
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Experience</p>
      <h2>Your life should feel connected, not scattered.</h2>
      <p>
        MyJourney gives users a central place to see goals, habits, reflections,
        values, and progress together. It is built to feel calm, human, and useful
        instead of overwhelming.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Daily and weekly planning</li>
        <li>Personal growth areas</li>
        <li>Reflection prompts</li>
        <li>Progress history</li>
        <li>Journey milestones</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-mj-showcase__image">
      {% if section.settings.showcase_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.showcase_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="MyJourney lifestyle preview"
          width="1200"
          height="850"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {% else %}
        {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'zd-mj-placeholder' }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-mj-roadmap">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Roadmap</p>
      <h2>What MyJourney becomes over time.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-mj-roadmap-grid">
      <article>
        <span>Phase 1</span>
        <h3>Personal dashboard</h3>
        <p>A calm home base for goals, habits, notes, and daily direction.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 2</span>
        <h3>Reflection system</h3>
        <p>Daily, weekly, and monthly prompts to help users learn from life.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 3</span>
        <h3>Journey map</h3>
        <p>A visual path showing progress, milestones, seasons, and growth.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 4</span>
        <h3>Integrated ecosystem</h3>
        <p>Connect MyJourney with Goal Grower, Blokkr, Kindlitt, and future tools.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-mj-support">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Support the mission</p>
      <h2>Help build tools for becoming better.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps fund design, development, testing, and the time needed
        to build a thoughtful life system instead of another noisy productivity app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-mj-btn zd-mj-btn--light">Support the Mission</a>
  </section>

  <section id="waitlist" class="zd-mj-waitlist">
    <p class="zd-mj-eyebrow">Early access</p>
    <h2>Join the MyJourney waitlist.</h2>
    <p>Get updates, beta access opportunities, and launch news.</p>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'zd-mj-form' %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter, myjourney-waitlist">

      <input
        type="email"
        name="contact[email]"
        placeholder="Email address"
        required
      >

      <button type="submit">Join Waitlist</button>
    {% endform %}
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "MyJourney Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_image",
      "label": "Hero image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "showcase_image",
      "label": "Showcase image"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "MyJourney Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}